// EXPECT: function 'eprint' collides with a runtime helper
// IDCPY-ACCEPTS
// A program's own eprint would be emitted as id_eprint, which is the helper
// the builtin calls. idc.py has no such builtin, so the name is free there.
eprint(string s) {
  print(s);
} return void;

main(int argc, string[] argv) {
  eprint("x");
} return int 0;
